  "Improved browser performance and stability": "改进浏览器性能和稳定性",
  "Improved browser reload capability when frozen": "冷冻后浏览器再装能力得到改进",
  "Improved error handling for TSC": "改进海训方案错误处理",
  "Improved error handling for TSC [Mavri]": "改进海训方案错误处理 [Mavri]",
  "Improved faction attack assistance notification settings": "改进派别攻击援助通知的设置",
  "Improved home screen widget functionality": "改进家庭屏幕部件功能",
  "Improved information provided for OC 2": "改进为OC 2提供的资料",
  "Improved mouse compatibility": "提高鼠鼠鼠的兼容性",
  "Improved player notes dialog interface": "改进的播放器笔记对话框界面",
  "Improved spacing between links in quick item response messages": "提高快速项目响应信息中链接之间的间隔",
  "Improved spies dialog with search and better performance": "改进间谍对话,以搜索和更好的表现",
  "Improved tab icons handling": "改进制表标签图标处理",
  "Improved troubleshooting steps for issues with Alerts": "改进解决警报问题解决问题的排除故障步骤",
  "Improved user auth recovery process": "改进用户验证回收流程",
  "Improved user script manager: includes remote fetching, auto update, auto JS file import and fixes": "改进用户脚本管理:包括远程取取、自动更新、自动 JS文件导入和修正",
  "Improved user script manager: includes remote fetching, auto update, auto JS file import and fixes [Kwack]": "改进用户脚本管理:包括远程取取、自动更新、自动 JS文件导入和修正 [Kwack]",
  "In Settings, Shortcuts, App icon menu. Each of the four slots can be a Torn page or one of your chats, shown when you long press the Torn PDA icon.": "在设置、快捷键、 App 图标菜单中。 四个空位中的每一个可以是一个撕破的页面或您的聊天页之一, 当您长时间按着Torn PDA 图标时显示。",
  "In Settings, under Discreet local notifications, turn on Schedule and pick the hours. Notifications created by Torn PDA and its server alerts are discreet between those hours. Torn private messages on iOS are not covered.": "在设置中, 根据本地密钥通知, 打开日程并选择时间。 由Torn PDA及其服务器警报生成的通知在这些时间之间是谨慎的。 iOS上被撕破的私人信息不包含在内。",
  "Increased time selection for manual hospital release notifications": "增加医院人工释放通知的时间选择",
  "Increased time selection for manual loot notifications": "增加人工抢掠通知的时间选择",
  "Issues with hidden foreign stocks and stakeouts": "与隐藏的外国储存和定点调查有关的问题",
  "Items / Chat: market prices show how old they are, Torn now updates them hourly": "/聊天:市场价格显示它们年老多少,",
  "Items and foreign stocks: inventory quantities are back": "物品和外国库存:库存数量已恢复",
  "Items: fixed display case": "项目: 固定显示大小写",
  "Keep only the scripts you need during a war or a chain. Enter it from the options menu of the scripts section, from the browser three-dotted icon or from a FAB button, then use the switches in the list to choose what runs in war mode. Your normal setup is kept untouched, so leaving it changes nothing else.": "只保留战争或连击期间所需的脚本。 从脚本部分的选项菜单、浏览器三点图标或FAB按钮中输入,然后在列表中使用开关来选择战争模式下运行的内容。 你正常的布局没有改变 所以别管它了",
  "Loaned medical items, drugs, energy drinks, alcohol, candy and boosters can be added to quick items as their own entry, marked with the faction shield. Using one spends the loaned item instead of your own.": "借来的医疗物品、药品、能源饮料、酒精、糖果和助推器可加到快件中,作为他们自己的入口,并标有派系盾牌。 使用借出的项目而不是用自己的项目。",
  "Local backups can now be exported in a shareable mode without API keys or auth data": "本地备份现在可以以可共享模式导出,无需 API 密钥或授权数据",
  "Local backups: private backups now need a key of at least 8 characters": "本地备份: 私有备份现在需要至少 8个字符的密钥",
  "Local backups: shareable backups and backups from another player import userscripts disabled": "本地备份: 来自其它播放器的共享备份和备份, 导入用户脚本已禁用",
  "Local backups: stronger encryption, backups made with 4.0.0 cannot be opened by older versions": "本地备份: 更强加密, 旧版本无法打开以 4. 0.0 提供的备份",
  "Locked tabs navigation exceptions now accept wildcards (*) and can be edited": "锁定标签的导航例外现在接受通配符 (*) 并可以编辑",
  "Loot: added customizable lead time options for automatic notifications (alerts)": "Loot: 添加可定制的自动通知(警报)周转时间选项",
  "Main settings section is now searchable": "主设置区域现在可以搜索",
  "Manual trigger: use the triple-dotted icon in the browser's tab bar, then tab the red bin icon to see more options.\n\nAutomatic task: activate a periodic removal in Settings / Advanced Browser Settings / Tabs": "手动触发器: 在浏览器的制表栏中使用三点点图标, 然后标签红箱图标以查看更多选项。\n\n自动任务: 在设置/ 高级浏览器设置/ Tabs 中激活定期删除",
  "Maximum loaded tabs, in Advanced browser settings, Memory. Tabs above the limit go to sleep and load again when you tap them, which avoids blank pages with many tabs open.": "在高级浏览器设置、 内存中的最大装入标签。 超过限制值的标签会进入睡眠并再次装入, 当你监听它们时, 它会避免空白页面, 许多标签打开了。",
  "Migrated app settings to new local database": "将应用程序设置迁移到新的本地数据库",
  "Moved settings search functionality to appbar": "将设置搜索功能移动到应用程序",
  "Network fixes": "网络修正",
  "Network fixes [bombel]": "网络修正 [bombel]",
  "New button in Advanced browser settings, Maintenance. It keeps the main tab, the cache and your Torn session.": "高级浏览器设置中的新按钮,维护。 它保留主制表、缓存和你的笔会话",
  "Notes are now properly shared between targets, war target, stakeouts and friends": "现在目标、战争目标、定点和朋友之间适当分享笔记",
  "Notifications: discreet notifications on a schedule": "通知:按时间表提出的谨慎通知",
  "On pages where the browser blocks storage, the GM helpers were not created at all, so every userscript on that page failed. They now keep working, and only the saved values are unavailable.": "在浏览器块存储页面上, 根本没有创建 GM 助手, 因此该页面的每个用户脚本都失败。 它们现在继续工作,只有保存的值是无法使用的。",
  "On wide screens with split screen enabled in Settings, press and hold a tab and drag it onto the app or the other panel to move it there, or double-tap it and use the \"open in split panel\" icon. Dragging the main tab opens a copy of it. Locked tabs stay in their group while tab lock warnings are enabled.\n\nPress and hold the divider, then drag it, to resize the panels. You can also choose where links tapped in the app open, in Settings next to Split screen. Dev Tools open in the other panel, next to the page.\n\nMore details in the Tips section.": "在宽屏幕上,在设置中启用了拆分屏幕, 按住标签并拖到应用程序或其他面板上将其移动到那里, 或双脚绘制它并使用“ 打开分割面板” 图标。 拖着主标签打开它的副本。 在启用标签锁定警告时, 锁定的标签会留在他们的组中。\n\n按住分隔符,然后拖动它,以调整面板的大小。 您也可以选择在“ 分割” 屏幕旁边的设置中, 在程序打开时在哪里打开链接。 Dev Tools 在另一面板中打开, 在页面旁边。\n\n详情见Tips部分。",
  "Only available for iOS 16.2 and above\n\nSee Alerts / Live Activities\n\nThis feature allows you to track your travel in real-time, providing updates on your journey directly on your device's lock screen or dynamic island.\n\nIMPORTANT: for the time being, live activities will only activate if travel starts or takes place at some point while with Torn PDA in the foreground.\n\nPlease note that this is a beta feature and may not work as expected in all cases (any feedback is appreciated).": "仅可用于IOS 16.2及以上\n\n见 \" 警报/活活活动 \"\n\n此功能允许您实时跟踪您的行程, 直接在您的设备锁屏或动态岛上提供您旅途的最新情况。\n\n重要的一点是:目前,只有在旅行开始或发生于某一时刻时,在前台与Torn PDA一起进行时,现场活动才会启动。\n\n请注意,这是一个贝塔特征,可能并非在所有情况下都能如预期的那样发挥作用(欢迎任何反馈)。",
  "Optimized API call rate when bringing app to foreground": "将应用程序引入前景下时优化 API 调用率",
  "Other several fixes": "其它数个修正",
  "Overhauled Quick Items selection and categories (wiped existing ones)": "快速项目选择和类别(已对现有项目进行剪动)",
  "Overhauled war target sorting: added smart score weighting, filters and improved hospital time handling": "战争目标分类:增加智能计分权重、过滤器和改进医院时间处理",
  "Player notes now support color-only entries": "玩家便记现在支持只使用色的条目",
  "Player notes system overhauled": "修改玩家笔记系统",
  "Player profile widget now shows active bounties": "播放器配置文件部件现在显示活动的弹出",
  "Profile section now uses about half the API calls": "概况部分现在使用大约一半的API电话",
  "Profile widget can now be hidden when attacking (shown by default)": "配置文件部件在攻击时可以隐藏( 默认显示)",
  "Profile: added Arson crime": "简介:添加纵火罪",
  "Profile: added OC v2 information to the misc card": "配置文件: 在错误卡上添加OC v2 信息",
  "Profile: added edit icon to shortcuts list (can be disabled)": "配置文件: 在快捷键列表中添加编辑图标( 可以禁用)",
  "Profile: added jobless warning with links to Hire Haven and newspaper (can be disabled)": "简介:加上与Hire Haven和报纸(可能残疾)链接的失业警告",
  "Profile: added option to show both TS stats charts and to select time range": "配置文件:添加选项,以显示 TS Stats 图表和选择时间范围",
  "Profile: added user's market items details": "简介:增加用户的市场项目细节",
  "Profile: choose which stats are shown in the Torn Stats chart": "配置文件:选择在刻录 Stats 图表中显示哪些国家",
  "Profile: fixed missing Misc section": "简介:固定缺失的杂项款次",
  "Profile: fixed spacing in stats chart when there is data missing": "配置文件:缺少数据时在统计图表中的固定间距",
  "Profile: floating action button can now be hidden": "配置文件: 浮控动作按钮现在可以隐藏",
  "Profile: manual hospital and jail notifications now follow changes in your release time": "简介:在释放时间发生变化后,现在有医院和监狱人工通知。",
  "Profile: tap your ID in the header to open your own profile in the browser": "配置文件: 在页眉中点击您的 ID 在浏览器中打开您自己的配置文件",
  "Profile: the race start notification icon now shows when it is set": "配置文件: 比赛开始通知图标在设定时显示",
  "Profile: work stats now show a total in the expanded view": "简介:工作统计现在在扩大的视野中显示总数",
  "Quick Items can now be disabled (personal and faction separately)": "Quick Project 现在可以禁用( 单独个人和派系)",
  "Quick Items have been redesigned to that they can be selected from TORN's item list.\n\nThis also allows new categories of quick items (e.g. weapons, armor, etc.) to be selected.\n\nFaction quick items remain unchanged.\n\n": "快速项目已经重新设计,以便从 TORN 的项目列表中选择。\n\n这也允许选择新的快件类别(例如武器、盔甲等)。\n\n行动快速物品保持不变。\n\n",
  "Quick Items: added option to disable inventory quantities": "快速项目:添加选项,禁用库存量",
  "Quick Items: added option to replace the add button (+) with a long-press gesture anywhere on the widget": "快速项目:添加选项,在部件的任意位置用长按手势替换添加按钮(+)",
  "Quick items: added an option to hide loadouts": "快速项目: 添加一个选项以隐藏加载",
  "Quick items: item icons no longer go missing after closing the picker": "快速项目: 关闭拾取器后项目图标不再丢失",
  "Quick items: item icons no longer go missing after closing the picker [xentac]": "快速项目: 关闭拾取器后项目图标不再丢失 [xentac]",
  "Quick items: support for items loaned by your faction": "速效项目:支助贵派别借借的物品",
  "Reinforced push notifications token persistence": "强化推力通知",
  "Removed obsolete providers": "已删除过时供应商",
  "Resolved an issue affecting the reordering of tabs": "解决了影响分级表重新排序的问题",
  "Resolved incorrect estimated stats calculation in the War section": "解决了战争部分计算不正确的估计数据",
  "Resolved issues with TS chart and jobless warning": "解决了与TS图表和无工作警告有关的问题",
  "Resolved issues with foreign stocks filtering": "解决外国储存过滤问题",
  "Resolved issues with the travel widget and graphic display problems on certain devices": "解决某些设备上的旅行部件和图形显示问题",
  "Saving an empty value wrote something the scripts could not read again, and it stayed there taking up script storage space. Those values are now removed instead.": "保存空值时写入了脚本无法再次读取的东西, 并一直保留在那里, 占用脚本存储空间。 这些价值现在被删除。",
  "Scripts and UI fixes": "脚本和 UI 修正",
  "Scripts and UI fixes [Kwack]": "脚本和 UI 修正 [Kwack]",
  "Scripts start sooner after a page loads, and PDA_http requests can go out before the page has finished loading, as in Tampermonkey.\n\nFor script developers: a script that runs at document-start and changes the page with the response should wait for the elements it needs. The developer guide is linked below.": "PDA_http请求可以在页面完成装入前发出,如Tamponkey。\n\n对于脚本开发者 : 在文件启动时运行的脚本, 并按响应修改页面, 应该等待它所需的元素。 开发者指南的链接见下文。",
  "Scripts: @match now follows Tampermonkey rules (http*, any port, pages with #)": "脚本 : @match 现在遵循塔帕门基规则( http* 、 任何端口、 页面 # )",
  "Scripts: @match now follows Tampermonkey rules (http*, any port, pages with #) [xentac]": "脚本 : @match 现在遵循塔帕门基规则( http* 、 任何端口、 页面 # ) [xentac]",
  "Scripts: a script no longer runs on the previous page after going back": "脚本: 返回后不再运行上一页上的脚本",
  "Scripts: a script no longer runs on the previous page after going back [xentac]": "脚本: 返回后不再运行上一页上的脚本 [xentac]",
  "Scripts: added option to temporarily disable all user scripts": "脚本: 添加选项以暂时禁用所有用户脚本",
  "Scripts: added war mode": "脚本: 添加战争模式",
  "Scripts: create your own modes besides war mode": "脚本: 在战争模式之外创建您自己的模式",
  "Scripts: faster and more reliable injection and PDA_http requests": "脚本:更快、更可靠注射和PDA_http请求",
  "Scripts: faster and more reliable injection and PDA_http requests [xentac]": "脚本:更快、更可靠注射和PDA_http请求 [xentac]",
  "Scripts: import overwrite mode no longer deletes other scripts": "脚本: 导入覆盖文字模式不再删除其他脚本",
  "Scripts: the list can now be searched and sorted": "脚本: 现在可以搜索列表并排序",
  "Search by name (or inside the code, if you enable it in the options menu) and sort the list alphabetically or by install date. You can also keep the scripts with a pending update at the top.": "按名称搜索( 或在代码内搜索, 如果您在选项菜单中启用它) 并按字母顺序或安装日期排序列表。 也可以保留脚本,在顶端有未更新的更新。",
  "See Settings / Theme.\n\nActivate this option to replace all colored texts with the default text color (white or black). \n\nThis can improve readability for users with color vision deficiencies, but might make it harder to identify the performance of some indicators.\n\nNote: this option only applies to the app and not to the web, and is not yet available in all sections. You can contact us to offer further suggestions.": "见设置/主题。\n\n激活此选项以默认文本颜色( 白色或黑色) 取代所有有色文字。 \n\n这可以提高有色视障的用户的可读性,但可能更难确定某些指标的效绩。\n\n注:本选项仅适用于应用程序,不适用于网络,尚未在所有章节中提供。 你可以联系我们 提出进一步的建议。",
  "Set notifications to remind you while you are sitting in a foreign country, so you don't forget you are abroad.\n\nEnable it in the Alerts section and pick the intervals you want (5 min, 15 min, 30 min, 1 h, 6 h, 12 h, 24 h) measured from the moment you land.\n\nThere is also an option to keep firing reminders while you are hospitalised abroad, off by default, so hospital stays pause the reminders and resume them once you are out.": "设置通知以提醒您在外国时, 不要忘记您在国外。\n\n启用警告部分, 并选择您在着陆时的间隔( 5分钟、 15分钟、 30分钟、 1小时、 6小时、 12小时、 24小时) 。\n\n若您在国外住院,也可选择继续发火提醒。若您出院后出院,医院会暂停发火提醒并恢复发火提醒。",
  "Settings > Screen Configuration (disabled by default)\n\nEnables the highest available refresh rate on supported devices (e.g., 90Hz, 120Hz) for smoother animations.\n\nMay increase battery consumption and device heat but provides smoother animations.": "设置 > 屏幕配置( 默认残疾)\n\n启用支持设备(如90Hz、120Hz)上可用于更平滑动画的最高更新速率。\n\n可能会增加电池消耗和装置热量,但提供更平滑的动画。",
  "Several code fixes to prevent memory leaks": "防止内存泄漏的若干代码修正",
  "Several code fixes to prevent memory leaks [DarXide]": "防止内存泄漏的若干代码修正 [DarXide]",
  "Several performance, code and documentation improvements": "几项业绩、代码和文件改进",
  "Several performance, code and documentation improvements [DarXide]": "几项业绩、代码和文件改进 [DarXide]",
  "Shortcuts can now be customized with different icons, color overlays, and border colors": "快捷键现在可以用不同的图标、颜色覆盖和边框颜色来定制",
  "Shortcuts: custom border color is now kept after restarting the app": "快捷键:重新启动应用程序后现在保留自定义边框颜色",
  "Some scripts save a lot of data, and until now they had to squeeze it into the small space the browser shares between Torn and every script, so heavy ones would run out of room and start misbehaving.\n\nScripts can now store their data with Torn PDA instead: much more space, its own room per script, and it survives clearing the browser cache. A green storage icon on the user scripts page marks the scripts that use it, and you can tap it to see how much they store and give them more room if they need it.\n\nThis is opt-in for script developers, so if a script you love keeps hitting its limits, let its author know the option is there. The developer guide is linked below.": "有些脚本保存了大量数据, 直到现在他们不得不将它挤到小空间里 浏览器共享在Torn和每个脚本之间, 所以重的脚本会跑出房间 开始做错事。\n\n脚本现在可以将其数据存储在Torn PDA 中: 更多空间, 每一个脚本都有自己的房间, 它能幸存下来清除浏览器缓存。 用户脚本页面上的绿色存储图标标记了使用它脚本的脚本, 你可以监听它来查看它们储存多少, 如果需要的话给他们更多空间。\n\n这是对脚本开发者的选入, 所以如果您喜欢的脚本 持续达到它的极限, 请让作者知道有选项。 开发者指南的链接见下文。",
  "Spies: added option to allow mixed sources, fixed persistence and other issues": "Spies:允许混合来源、固定持久性和其他问题的新增选项",
  "Split discreet notifications toggle into local (Settings section) and Alerts": "拆分谨慎通知, 切换到本地( 设置区域) 和提醒",
  "Stock market alerts: option to hide stocks where you already own a benefit block": "股票市场警报:在已经拥有利益区块的情况下隐藏股票的备选办法",
  "Stock market alerts: option to hide stocks where you already own a benefit block [Juoku]": "股票市场警报:在已经拥有利益区块的情况下隐藏股票的备选办法 [Juoku]",
  "Stock market section: added pull to refresh": "股市部分:为刷新而增加的拉力",
  "Tabs now return to the same spot after the browser recovers a page": "在浏览器恢复页面后, Tab 现在返回到同一位置",
  "Tabs you have not opened for a while are put to sleep to keep Torn PDA light, and they load again next time you tap them.\n\nYou can now pick how long that takes, or leave it on the recommended setting, in the new Memory section at the bottom of the advanced browser settings.": "你一阵子没有打开的标签 被放入睡眠中 以保持撕开的PDA光线, 下次你拍的时候再装上。\n\n现在您可以在高级浏览器设置的底部的新内存部分中选择需要多长时间, 或者将其留在推荐的设置上。",
  "Tap the legend under the chart to open a dialog where you can hide any of strength, defense, speed and dexterity.": "将图例放入图表下以打开一个对话框, 您可以隐藏任何力量、 防御、 速度和灵巧性。",
  "Tapping your name still shows your online status, and a long press still copies your ID.": "点击您的姓名仍然显示您的网络状态, 长的媒体仍然复制您的身份证。",
  "Targets can now be sorted by time to hospital release": "目标现在可以按时间分类,直到医院释放",
  "The \"This person is currently in hospital and cannot be attacked\" message is replaced with a countdown of their remaining hospital time. The page automatically updates to \"Start fight\" when they are released.": "“这个人目前住院,无法受到攻击”, 页面在发布时自动更新到“ 开始战斗 ” 。",
  "The FFScouter section in Chaining has a Bounty Board tab next to the Target Finder. It lists the players with bounties placed through FFScouter and what each hit pays: attack one from there, hospitalize them and claim the hit, and FFScouter checks your attack log and pays you. You can also place your own bounties, paid with Xanax, and follow them from the same tab.\n\nThe first time you open it you are asked to accept the Bounty Board rules and data policy, and the tab can be hidden from Settings if you are not interested.": "连击中的FFScuter部分在目标查找器旁边有一个 Bounty Board 标签。 它列出了那些通过FFSFCUCATER放置的弹簧球员和每个击球手的报酬:从那里攻击一个球员,将其送进医院并声称被击中;FSFCUATER检查你的攻击记录并付给你工资。 您也可以自备钱财,用Xanax支付,然后从同一个标签上跟踪。\n\n第一次打开它时, 您被要求接受 Bunty 董事会的规则和数据政策, 如果您不感兴趣, 标签可以隐藏在设置之外。",
  "The app no longer closes if the system kills the browser page, including tabs in the background": "如果系统杀死浏览器页面, 包括背景中的标签, 应用程序将不再关闭",
  "The app shrinks into a small window that stays on top of other apps. Tap the window icon in the chain widget to watch the chain (counter, chain watcher colors, blinking border and, in panic mode, a Panic attack button), choose \"Watch players\" in the options of Targets, War or Retaliation (or the window icon in Attacks and FFScouter) and tap up to 4 player cards (hospital or jail countdown, green when their status changes), or in Stakeouts to watch all of them at once.\n\nWhile a floating window is open, stakeout alerts appear as a banner and as a phone notification. Settings let you turn it on or off for each place, and optionally open the chain window when you leave the app. Closing it with the system X is like leaving the app: the chain watcher stops alerting.\n\nMore details in the Tips section.": "该应用程序缩入一个小窗口, 保持在其他应用程序之上。 在连击部件中键入窗口图标以观察连击(柜子、连击守望者颜色、闪烁边框,在恐慌模式下是恐慌攻击按钮),在目标、战争或报复选项中选择“观察玩家”(或者袭击和FFScuter中的窗口图标),并窃取到多达4张玩家卡(医院或监狱倒计时或监狱倒计时,当他们的状况发生变化时是绿色的),或在监视员中同时观看所有玩家。\n\n当浮动窗口打开时,监视警报作为横幅和电话通知出现。 设置允许您打开或关闭每个地方, 当您离开应用程序时可随意打开链窗口。 用系统X关闭它就像离开应用程序: 锁链监视器停止警告。\n\n详情见Tips部分。",
  "The browser now auto-recovers if a tab fails to load on startup": "如果标签在启动时无法装入, 浏览器现在自动恢复",
  "The double-tap on Torn's header bar to exit full screen can now be disabled": "现在可以禁用 Torn 标题栏上要退出整个屏幕的双图示",
  "The new handler allows web content / user scripts to launch external applications (like Discord) by passing a URL from JavaScript to the native side of the app\n\nPlease visit the ./docs section in Github for more information.": "新处理器允许新处理器将一个URL从 JavaScript 传送到应用程序的本地端, 从而允许网络内容/ 用户脚本启动外部应用程序( 如 Discord)\n\n请访问Github的./docs科了解更多信息。",
  "The new handler allows web content / user scripts to share files (like CSVs or images) generated within the browser to the native side of the app, triggering the system share sheet.\n\nPlease visit the ./docs section in Github for more information.": "新处理器允许网络内容/用户脚本将浏览器中生成的文件(如 CSVs 或图像)共享到应用程序的本地端, 触发系统共享工作表。\n\n请访问Github的./docs科了解更多信息。",
  "The notes dialog of any player now has an FFScouter tab with the notes stored in FFScouter: your personal ones, the ones written by your faction and those from the FFScouter team. You can write new personal or faction notes there, and copy notes between FFScouter and your Torn PDA note.\n\nWar, target and profile cards show how many FFScouter notes a player has: tap the counter to open them, or the notebook icon for your Torn PDA note. Notes are stored by FFScouter, so they follow you to any device and to the FFScouter scripts. In Settings, under FFScouter, you can choose which note the cards show when there are both, or turn them off.": "任何玩家的笔记对话框现在都有一个FFScuter标签,上面有存于FFScuter的笔记:你的个人笔记、你派别写的笔记和FFScuter团队的笔记。 您可在那里撰写新的个人或派别笔记,并抄写FFFScuter和Torn PDA笔记之间的笔记。\n\n战争、目标卡和剖析卡显示玩家有多少FFFScuter的音符: 点击柜台打开它们, 或您刻录 PDA 便条的笔记本图标。 纸条由FFScuter存储, 所以他们跟随你到任何设备 和FFScuter脚本。 在设置中,在 FFScuter 下,您可以选择两个都显示时哪个注解牌,或者将其关闭。",
  "The option that limits restock alerts to your current country has a new setting under it. Turn off \"alert while still flying\" and you will only hear about a restock once you have landed and can actually buy, instead of while you are in the air.": "限制当前国家再充电警报的选项在它下有一个新的设置。 关闭“在飞行时关闭待命状态” 只有在降落后你才能听到关于充气器的声音 并且可以购买,而不是在空中的时候",
  "The player notes system has been completely redesigned so that all notes are now shared between targets, war targets, stakeouts, friends and profile pages.\n\nFor this last item, a new widget can be enabled in the player profile page to show or allow to take notes directly in the browser (see Settings / Advanced Browser Settings / Player Profiles)\n\nNotes can be accessed and edited from any of these sections, and will be reflected in all other sections.\n\nPlease note that existing notes have been migrated to the new system, but you may want to review them to ensure they are still relevant.\n\nYou can access all notes from the Settings / Stats and Player Notes section.": "玩家笔记系统已经完全重新设计,现在所有笔记都由目标、战争目标、定点采访、朋友和档案页面共享。\n\n对于此最后一个项, 可在播放器配置页面中启用新部件, 以显示或允许在浏览器中直接记录笔记( 参见 设置/ 高级浏览器设置/ 播放器配置)\n\n这些节中的任何一节均可查阅和编辑这些说明,这些说明将反映在所有其他各节。\n\n请注意,现有备注已迁移到新系统,但你不妨加以审查,以确保这些备注仍然相关。\n\n您可以访问设置/ Stats 和玩家 Notes 区域的所有便笺。",
  "The reload icon now reacts the moment you tap it, turning into a spinner while the page loads, and it got a bigger touch area. Tapping it again still forces a fresh reload if a page gets stuck.": "重新装入图标现在会随着你点击它而反应, 当页面加载时变成一个旋转符, 它有一个更大的触摸区域。 如果一页被卡住,再次尝试它仍迫使重新加载。",
  "The terminal can now be resized, shared and its text is selectable.\n\nYou can also expand the terminal in a dialog covering the whole screen, which includes the capacity to enter text and execute commands.\n\nTerminals are now independent for each tab, and you can also clear them individually.": "终端现在可以调整大小、共享,其文字是可以选择的。\n\n您也可以在一个包含整个屏幕的对话框中扩展终端,包括输入文本和执行命令的能力。\n\n终端现在对每个标签都是独立的,您也可以单独清除。",
  "The user scripts page now has a TornTools section listing the features that the TornTools team publishes as standalone scripts, sorted by category and searchable.\n\nInstall the ones you want with a single tap and they will be kept up to date like any other script.\n\nThese scripts are made and maintained by the TornTools team, not by Torn PDA, so please report any problem with them through their own channels, which are linked in the section.": "用户脚本页面现在有一个 TornTools 部分,其中列出了TrnTools团队作为独立脚本出版的特征,按类别和可搜索文件分类。\n\n安装您想要的单开关, 并且它们会像其它脚本一样不断更新。\n\n这些脚本是由TornTools团队制作和保存的,而不是由Torn PDA制作和维护的,所以请通过他们自己的频道报告与这些脚本有关的任何问题。",
  "Third-party scripts can now read, write and delete several stored values in a single call, using GM.getValues / GM_getValues, GM.setValues / GM_setValues and GM_deleteValues, matching modern scripting behavior.\n\nGM injection is also more robust, with safer value reads and style insertion before the page is fully ready.\n\nSee the GM compatibility documentation (docs/userscripts/gm-compatibility.md) for the full list of supported APIs.": "第三方脚本现在可以使用GM.getValues/GM_getValues、GM.setvalues/GM_seetValues和GM_deleteValues来一次性读、写和删除几个存储的值,这符合现代脚本行为。\n\n转基因注射也更加有力,在网页完全准备就绪之前插入更安全的读数和样式。\n\n支持的API完整清单见全球机制兼容性文件(docs/userscripts/gm-commontibility.md)。",
  "Torn PDA will record the latest 30 API errors for each session.\n\nThis is useful for troubleshooting issues with the API, normally upon request from Torn PDA developers.\n\nIt can be found in Settings, under the Troubleshooting section.": "被撕破的PDA将为每届会议记录最新的30个API错误。\n\n通常应Torn PDA开发商的要求,用于解决与API的问题。\n\n可以在设置中找到, 麻烦排除栏下。",
  "Torn PDA will try to assess whether your faction has already switched to OC v2 every couple of days (in order to save API calls). Hoever, you can manually set the OC version in Settings / Organized Crime\n\nShould you wish to return to OC v1 (if you join a faction that hasn't changed yet), remember to revert the OC version in Settings": "Torn的PDA将试图评估你的派系是否已经每隔几天转而使用OC v2(以节省API电话)。 Hoever, 您可以在设置/ 有组织犯罪中手动设定OC版本\n\n如果您想要返回OC v1( 如果您加入一个尚未改变的派别) , 请记住在设置中返回 OC 版本",
  "Torn removed inventory from API v1 in 2023 and it is now available again in API v2, one call per item category. To keep API usage under your control, inventory is only loaded when you tap the new box icon in Items or Foreign stocks (or pick an inventory filter or sort). Items then shows how many of each item you own (display case included) and their total value. If you would rather have it loaded on entering those sections, enable \"Load inventory automatically\" in Settings, under API call rate. Torn caches inventory for an hour, so recent purchases can take up to an hour to show.": "从2023年的 API v1 中撕开的库存清单,现在可在 API v 2 中再次查到,每类一次通话。 为了将API的使用保持在您的控制之下,只有当您在项目或外国库存(或选择一个库存过滤器或排序)中打开新框图标时,才装入库存。 项目然后显示您拥有的每个项目( 包含播放大小写) 的数量及其总价值。 如果您宁愿在输入这些区域时装上它, 请根据 API 调用率在设置中启用“ 自动登录库存 ” 。 将缓存库存撕毁一小时,所以最近的采购可以耗时一个小时才能显示。",
  "Trades: added TornW3B sync support": "贸易:加起来的TrnW3B同步支持",
  "Trades: added button to copy Torn Exchange receipt URL": "交易:添加按钮以复制回转汇收据 URL",
};
